[en.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_DESTINY]
Meeting with the Reindeers

[en.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_DESTINY_desc]
The reindeers finally agreed to have a talk with us. We will use a tough attitude to force them to surrender in the talk.

[zh.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_DESTINY]
与驯鹿的会面

[zh.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_DESTINY_desc]
驯鹿最终同意与我们展开一次会谈，在会谈上，我们将用强硬的态度逼迫她们屈服。

